error[RB0107]: event `Go` has the name of a record type declared in `RB0107-event-named-like-a-type.road`
 --> RB0107-event-named-like-a-type.road:9:9
  |
1 | type Go { a: int }
  |      -- declared here
...
9 |   event Go
  |         ^^
  |
  = help: the IR names an event's type by the event's name, so it must not be the name of a type, error or machine; rename one of them

